{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>ולו גוענו.</b> Would that we had perished." "<b>בגוע אחינו.</b> At the death of our brethren by the plague — this teaches that death by thirst is more disgraceful than it." "<b>בגוע.</b> It is a noun, like 'at the death of our brethren.' And it is not possible to explain it as 'when our brethren died,' for if so it would have been pointed בִּגְוֹעַ."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:41.265482906Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}